{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックサイト個握！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声の調子が悪くて\n心配おかけしました。\nきこえてる自分の声は\nいつも通りなのに\n周囲からしたら変みたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部2部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紫のニット帽\nグレーのニットワンピ\n時計の中身のペンダントは\n頑張って買ったもの\nフラボアの靴下"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白のブラウス\nチェックのストール\n古着のデニム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服意識したら\n握手会で暑かったよーふおふお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"膝の擦り傷の心配おかけしました。\nええ！屈伸できるくらい\nもうへっちゃらです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、乃木どこの番長対決の服装が\nかなり評判のようで嬉しいっっ\nいろんな方にほめられた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ガチギャルとかヤンキー\nなんじゃないかって心配した\nという方がちらほら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、違いますって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時は調子乗って\nノリノリになりすぎたんですって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログに心配って\n単語3つもあるじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい\n心配おかけしました。(4つ目)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/21/6784561/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くちびるピンク色\n全身火照ってる熱い\n熱冷ましシート貼って早く寝なきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}